1, 2009<br/>Summer Update 2009</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20170909232807&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Beer_8eddda.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a flask with magical oil.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 1.80 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">Eclesius made it for you to oil the door of the demon cage.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Eclesius\">Eclesius</a> will make this if you give him the right ingredients. It disappears once used.<br/>\nLooks the same as a <a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20with%20Oil%20and%20Blood\">Flask with Oil and Blood</a> and vials of <a href=\"#/wiki/Beer\">Beer</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Mead\">Mead</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/MUD\">Mud</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Oil\">Oil</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Rum\">Rum</a> and Tea.\n</p><p>Used in <a href=\"#/quest/the-scatterbrained-sorcerer-quest\">The Scatterbrained Sorcerer Quest</a>. You need Vial of <a href=\"#/wiki/Oil\">Oil</a>, a <a href=\"#/wiki/Skull%20%28Item%29\">Skull</a>, a <a href=\"#/wiki/Red%20Apple\">Red Apple</a> and a <a href=\"#/wiki/Wolf%20Paw\">Wolf Paw</a> to make it.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div sty